INSERT INTO `xy_index_msg` VALUES (12, 'Company Profile', '<p>The vision of Amazon\'s task distribution platform is to create the world\'s most reliable and frictionless green business development system, change and increase store sales prospects for sellers, and provide employment opportunities for customers. Amazon is Asia\'s largest shopping platform, with 35 million products from more than 125,000 regional, national and international brands and retailers, covering more than 800 different categories. With hundreds of millions of users and tens of millions of sellers, Amazon International is a shopping website for international Internet users, providing delivery services to more than 60,000 international towns. Amazon is currently working with Softbank, BlackRock, Temasek, Foxconn, Alibaba, eBay Inc., Premji Invest, Intel Investment, Bessemer Venture Partners, Ratan Tata, Gumtree, Olx, Flipkart, Takealot, Kalahari, Ebay.com, Junkmail, etc. Amazon is famous for having many world-renowned investors and individuals. Amazon Asia Mall is the first choice for hundreds of millions of online shopping enthusiasts because it has more than 10 million products and can be delivered quickly even in the most remote villages on the earth. Daily specials, discounts and deals can lower prices and provide buyers with valuable products. Dear customers! Let\'s get started! We have good news for you, all you need is an Internet-connected mobile phone, laptop or tablet to start joining our team. Accept daily tasks on the Amazon Intelligent Cloud Service Platform, pay attention to the shopping process, complete Amazon merchant task orders, and easily earn seller discounts. Participate in work anytime, anywhere, and experience the convenience of making money with your mobile phone! The application is quick and easy to operate, and more than 99% of the public in Asia and Africa can easily join this lucrative business.</p>', 1, 1785236229, 0, 'admin');
INSERT INTO `xy_index_msg` VALUES (13, 'Rule Description', '<p>This platform is a third-party intelligent matching platform for global malls. The existing platform and merchants and shopping platforms (SoftBank, BlackRock, Temasek, AilExpress, Foxconn, Alibaba, eBay Inc., Premji Invest, Intel Capital, Bessemer Venture Partners, Shein, Gumtree, Olx, Takealot, Kalahari, Ebay.com, Junkmail, Known) use intelligent systems to match merchant orders with platform users to increase sales data for each store. Dear member mall: In order to prevent illegal activities such as money laundering and stolen orders, members must complete multiple tasks and withdraw cash on the same day. After confirming that the claim is successful, the arrival time is 5-10 minutes, and no more than 30 minutes during peak hours. The specific arrival time varies from bank to bank. Order grabbing operation process: Apply for task-click grab order-mail merge-send immediately. (The system automatically processes the order), and the fee is settled immediately. When the platform matches the user\'s order, the platform will send the order information to the merchant backend. If the user does not submit the order for 2 hours, the order will be frozen to avoid online shopping platform monitoring. After the order is frozen, the order funds will also be frozen. You must complete the order to unlock the funds. Please be aware. 1: Generate an order within the fixed balance of the account, and the modification will take effect 24 hours after completion! 2: The acquired order needs to be completed within 2 hours. Failure to complete may cause the order status to be stuck. If the order status is stuck due to personal reasons, you need to activate the order yourself. 3: The Amazon platform system is based on LBS technology and is automatically monitored (cloud). If the platform finds that you have created multiple accounts, it will be considered a violation and the account will be permanently frozen. 4: When you start a task, it is deemed that you have accepted the platform rules. If the order is not completed due to personal reasons, you will be compensated for the losses caused to the merchant. And submit it to the relevant local credit reporting agency (bad credit: it will affect your house purchase, car loan, children\'s scholarship, etc., please be careful!) The task will be randomly assigned by the system. It is normal to have more or less. It must be completed after receiving the order and cannot be cancelled. If you mind, please do not start your task.</p>', 1, 1785236229, 0, 'admin');
INSERT INTO `xy_index_msg` VALUES (14, 'Agent Cooperation', '<p>The three-level recommendation is a multi-level recommendation profit model that can achieve the maximum share of the agency model. Recruit more subordinate employees to lay a solid foundation for the establishment of the work team. Easily get discounts on subordinate tasks and easily earn 500 to 20,000 rupees</p>', 1, 1785236229, 0, 'admin');
